13: <div class="app">
14: <header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="brandmark">✦</div><div><h1>little orbit</h1><small>pocket-sized lives</small></div></div><div class="top-actions"><div class="day-pill" id="day-pill">🌱 Waiting for a hatchling</div><button class="icon-btn" id="sound-btn" title="Toggle sound" aria-label="Toggle sound">♫</button></div></header>
15: <main class="layout"><section class="left"><div class="scene" id="scene"><div class="sun"></div><div class="cloud">☁</div><div class="scene-label">your little world</div><div class="scene-controls"><button class="round-control" id="sleep-btn">🌙 Lights out</button></div><span class="ground-deco left">🌿</span><span class="ground-deco right">🌼</span><div id="pet-area"></div></div><section class="status-card"><div class="card-heading"><h2>Little needs</h2><span class="hint" id="last-care">A little love goes a long way</span></div><div class="meters" id="meters"></div></section></section>
16: <aside class="right"><section class="care-card"><div class="profile"><div class="avatar" id="profile-avatar">🥚</div><div><h2 id="pet-title">An egg is waiting</h2><p id="pet-subtitle">Your next tiny adventure starts here</p></div><span class="stage-badge" id="stage-badge">Unhatched</span></div><div class="care-actions" id="care-actions"></div><p class="care-note" id="care-note">Every little gesture helps your new friend thrive.</p></section><section class="games-card"><div class="card-heading"><h2>Play together</h2><span class="hint" id="game-count">4 games per lifetime</span></div><div class="games-list" id="games-list"></div></section><section class="legacy-card"><div class="legacy-head"><h2>✨ Little legacies</h2><button id="legacy-info">Your collection</button></div><div id="legacy-list"></div></section></aside></main>
